	abstract = {We construct a unital separable C*-algebra \$\{{\textbackslash}textbackslashcal Z\}\$ as an analog of the hyperfinite type \$II\_\{1\}\$ factor. Besides being nuclear, simple, projectionless, and infinite-dimensional, \$\{{\textbackslash}textbackslashcal Z\}\$ has a unique tracial state, and is KK-equivalent to \$\{{\textbackslash}textbackslashBbb C\}\$ , the algebra of complex numbers. It is shown that unital endomorphisms on \$\{{\textbackslash}textbackslashcal Z\}\$ are approximately inner, and that \$\{{\textbackslash}textbackslashcal Z\}\$ is isomorphic to the infinite tensor product of its replicas. It is also shown that \$A{\textbackslash}textbackslashcong \{{\textbackslash}textbackslashcal Z\}{\textbackslash}textbackslashotimes A\$ for certain interesting classes of unital simple nuclear C*-algebras A of real rank zero.},
